  "body": "Looking for a brand-new legal home and income in Millwater? Opportunities like this don’t come along often. Set on an approximately 847sqm section with around 323sqm of floor area, this spacious single-level property offers a four-bedroom main home, a separate two-bedroom income and 4 off-street parking spaces.\r\n\r\nMain Home:\r\nThe main home has plenty of room for the family, with four bedrooms and two separate living areas. The kitchen is a real highlight, with plenty of bench space and storage, opening to the spacious dining and family area. A separate lounge gives you another comfortable place to relax.\r\n\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms including master ensuite, plus a separate toilet\r\n• Large kitchen with spacious dining and family living\r\n• Separate lounge and separate laundry\r\n• Internal-access double garage plus 3 off-street parking spaces\r\n\r\nLegal Income:\r\n\r\nThe two-bedroom income is a great addition, with its own kitchen, living and dining area, bathroom and separate laundry.\r\n\r\n• 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom\r\n• Kitchen, living and dining area, plus separate laundry\r\n• Internal-access single garage plus 1 off-street parking space\r\n\r\nIdeal for extended family, or live in the main home and enjoy extra income from the separate two-bedroom dwelling. You’ll also enjoy the convenience of Millwater, with shops, schools and everyday amenities close by, plus easy access to the motorway.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
